"text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Digital Endoscopy"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Equipment Troubleshooting"}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest progression is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Allied Health Foundation","Endoscopy Technology Training","GI Lab Internship","GI Lab / Endoscopy Technician","Advanced Endoscopy Specialist","Endoscope Reprocessing / Quality Specialist OR Clinical Applications Specialist","Training / Leadership / Medical-Device Technology"]},{"type":"p","text":"For a student interested in hands-on clinical technology, gastroenterology procedures and medical equipment, GI laboratory technology provides a strong career path."},{"type":"p","text":"The most valuable long-term combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Endoscopy expertise","infection-control/reprocessing excellence","advanced procedure exposure","equipment knowledge","digital/AI-enabled endoscopy awareness."],"sep":"+"}]}]}